# Pairs with NoLostWrite. The re-seed completes without replacing the
# receiver's contents, so the receiver keeps the bootstrap's shorter prefix
# while the shipper resumes from its old cursor.
MODULE: NoLostWriteReseedKeepsOldContents
TARGET: NoLostWrite
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a re-seed does not install the fresh export
PERTURBS: Reseed

--- FIND
    /\ recv' = Upto(head)
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: the fresh export is not installed.
    /\ recv' = recv
--- END